{"parse": {"title": "12TH-20", "pageid": 127805, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-19\" title=\"12TH-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-20</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-21\" title=\"12TH-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.80.E5.90.8E.E7.9A.84.E9.98.B2.E7.BA.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"最后的防线\">最后的防线</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 最后的防线</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Last Defense</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>跨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>战<span class=\"color-value\"></span>马<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>因<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>土<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11220</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_3_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_3_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_3_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>太好了，是将军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>列夫丘克？！你——你还活着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>没有时间寒暄了，敌方集团军正在向河南岸靠拢，装甲已经开进了红柳树村——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>至少两个装甲师和一个陆军师的兵力，此外还有三个辅助炮兵团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>了解，我已收到你的汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电台的那一侧，对方显然松了一口气，并瘫软在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>背景中的枪声隐约变得更清晰——伊戈尔希望那是一种错觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>报告你的位置，上士。我会立刻派人营救你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电台另一侧的人沉默许久，然后笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>背景的枪弹声显而易见地变得更近，更令人……恐惧。子弹仿佛掠过了耳边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-309211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-309211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-309211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>现在情况如何，你是否预留了撤退的道路？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>报告长官，雅罗斯拉夫·列夫丘克顺利完成了任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>托勒密急不可耐地挤到了送话器跟前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>什么意思？你**[狮鹫军粗口]的不准放弃，不准死！我现在就去带你回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>托勒密，你这臭小子。别再给将军添麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炮弹声逐渐盖过了上士的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-531401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列夫丘克：</div><div>我从不后悔成为您麾下的士兵，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嘟——嘟——嘟。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电台信号在枪声中消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉重的喘息声也随之消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>整备部队，托勒密。除防空炮手外所有人，撤出别列格勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>撤出别列格勒？要退回安全屋吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不，向骑兵军塞契集结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>格鲁托夫从我们这里带走的东西，我们要让他一一吐出来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狮鹫军带来了最坏的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长咽下了悲痛，让写满牺牲数字的简报消失在炭火中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞契沉浸在一片肃穆中时，他已经做出了判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>红柳树村会是格鲁托夫攻城的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>一旦失守，城市将直接暴露给一支火力凶猛的神秘学装甲部队。装甲师最依赖的是供给线……需要有人去掐断这条命脉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我有办法带人从内部奇袭红柳树村。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>纵使狮鹫军有村内捣毁敌人部队的能力……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>参谋长第三次从沙盘的这头踱步到另一头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>但谁去阻挡格鲁托夫源源不断的补给线？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>我看塞契里还有很多牵马的骑兵，他们能不能——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>都是孩子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃双手砸在了桌上，冲击让用来推演的棋子纷纷移了位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>十八岁以上的骑兵第一波出征就派出去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-529813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-529813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-529813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>剩下的都是些为了一口饱饭，谎报年纪混进来的小孩，连握缰的茧都没磨出来，嫩得和刚出壳的潜鸭没两样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>莎宾娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长拍了拍她的背，推着她走到了营帐之外。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少年们披挂着空荡的军服，步枪背带深勒进单薄的肩胛，马刀鞘尾拖拽在未长硬的腿骨旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们静立如一片削瘦的黑杨林，稚嫩的喉结在绷紧的领口下滚动，却只为塞契带来了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这种沉默压制住了她的怒火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>你们知道自己在做什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>跨上战马，离开家乡，然后死在战场上……之后再也回不了家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>您别小看我了！我可是哥萨克，和我的哥哥、姐姐、爸爸、妈妈一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>是啊！我身体里流着骑兵的血，这是英雄的血！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>我们是哥萨克，哥萨克从来不怕上战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>就算断手断脚也没什么可怕的。家乡的命运得我们来决定！这是必要的牺牲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似曾相识的话语撞击在情感的底线上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你看见了，伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我会带领这支队伍撵走那些戴面具的疯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我要把这片土地还给这些孩子们，把未来交到他们手上——这个时代的顿河，并不由我们来定义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长红着眼睛，看向这些消瘦的影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我们会取得胜利。告诉我这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>我们会取得胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">少年骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>我们会把那些疯子赶出我们的家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未变声的呼喊如汛期的顿河浪潮般层层叠叠，凿穿了塞契的每一寸垛口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长回过头，对上叛军首领深沉的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>伊戈尔，这是我们最后的机会了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手在颤抖，周围所有人都看得一清二楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但无人指摘他的战栗。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-20"}}